      "filename": "Nuruosmaniye Mosque 0277.jpg",
      "title": "File:Nuruosmaniye Mosque 0277.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/dd/Nuruosmaniye_Mosque_0277.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nuruosmaniye_Mosque_0277.jpg",
